    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0064",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Besides opportunities and resources, intellectual and artistic abilities are also factors.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c02f5176090fd3ca6539f41b49a9eb4c52fbeeef9cc610aef6f479e7ec91ee3d",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "b2ab6dbbb105405f3e1353507c90998a4c7c653f39f557d83e2a8413eae533c3",
      "passageSha256": "ea56e3c08b4ee2a0d2a510d668d026b6887136f4e0d70fd63463021aaf8112ec",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0065",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Simon Ramo, whose New York Times obituary was rated as particularly psychologically rich, was an aerospace engineer.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7c74321dee0d7d77f901e097b98d82c4d572a36980b20360e17bc83d3691f7db",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "b2ab6dbbb105405f3e1353507c90998a4c7c653f39f557d83e2a8413eae533c3",
      "passageSha256": "ea56e3c08b4ee2a0d2a510d668d026b6887136f4e0d70fd63463021aaf8112ec",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0066",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-s003",
      "sentenceText": "He earned a PhD in physics and engineering from the California Institute of Technology and later developed intercontinental ballistic missiles, or ICBMs.",
      "sentenceSha256": "f0fc4a14bfcbee41dc49646d44aef96934ad09243304e7c980638ea6079bc753",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-045",
      "parentFingerprint": "b2ab6dbbb105405f3e1353507c90998a4c7c653f39f557d83e2a8413eae533c3",
      "passageSha256": "ea56e3c08b4ee2a0d2a510d668d026b6887136f4e0d70fd63463021aaf8112ec",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0067",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-s005",
      "sentenceText": "He died at age 103.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7580c26daee2fbb7f024a0c9f27f2a04753d6f3a743b4fba7ce233e393621e54",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-046",
      "parentFingerprint": "5affb5b5fe6a346aa971c70a11afc31370b245b1e2b96f4103cd9aac44a983b3",
      "passageSha256": "7cb9fdc46c72b15b8265651c374d5b5c901dec8aed299fc7ce38b44616ba2668",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0068",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-s008",
      "sentenceText": "He was also interested in other topics, including tennis strategy—he later wrote a book on that, too.",
      "sentenceSha256": "5103dae7565e1cd621617dca0daa8fd79eccd4f5a5bd11069afb4845e06ad921",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-046",
      "parentFingerprint": "5affb5b5fe6a346aa971c70a11afc31370b245b1e2b96f4103cd9aac44a983b3",
      "passageSha256": "7cb9fdc46c72b15b8265651c374d5b5c901dec8aed299fc7ce38b44616ba2668",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0069",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-s010",
      "sentenceText": "When he was asked about his politics, he replied, “I am a registered opportunist.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "b38b49e40025868af93024712917694498d4eedbd38ad56642d25f70be705c7a",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-047",
      "parentFingerprint": "3a0a86ff2900adeec7e1aa7f772900fc9c3dee408646291bd815eb51307a0f22",
      "passageSha256": "e3ea9b299d20d3dd98b318e3e32aaa976e8dfdee2512515f844cd109bfde8293",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0070",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-s012",
      "sentenceText": "He had diverse interests and an amazing intellect.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a1805c87b7b832b418524f06d8446e122027e258fec4826db325afed13f083a6",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-02115-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-047",
      "parentFingerprint": "3a0a86ff2900adeec7e1aa7f772900fc9c3dee408646291bd815eb51307a0f22",
      "passageSha256": "e3ea9b299d20d3dd98b318e3e32aaa976e8dfdee2512515f844cd109bfde8293",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0071",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Another example of a person who lived a psychologically rich life is novelist Louis Cha (also known as Jin Yong), whose obituary was featured in the Straits Times.",
      "sentenceSha256": "38c45b4afca7da3a80e81e94f6a9e8e09e52b62c18a25f8f71f971b0f18d12a7",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-048",
      "parentFingerprint": "c256d8fbcfd0caa3aa40864d77d2c5c3e4650606a7777ee94438fa3d7160ad1b",
      "passageSha256": "e5bb9a7298b52d42bad03cff383b4c6c97e268f84ef4f665ed06b32d051b6b9c",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0072",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Cha was born in China and started out as a journalist in Shanghai before transferring to his newspaper’s Hong Kong office in the 1950s.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3bc0a31c696a3eb40d87fc1924f1ee988fa0cf5348b3c64fd18955faa1a67267",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-048",
      "parentFingerprint": "c256d8fbcfd0caa3aa40864d77d2c5c3e4650606a7777ee94438fa3d7160ad1b",
      "passageSha256": "e5bb9a7298b52d42bad03cff383b4c6c97e268f84ef4f665ed06b32d051b6b9c",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0073",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-s003",
      "sentenceText": "He wrote an enormously popular series of novels inspired by martial arts history from 1955 until 1972.",
      "sentenceSha256": "ce3832d4737530acbeac046bd8e6c0858ed87028c704a00325e0c7b757a739a4",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-048",
      "parentFingerprint": "c256d8fbcfd0caa3aa40864d77d2c5c3e4650606a7777ee94438fa3d7160ad1b",
      "passageSha256": "e5bb9a7298b52d42bad03cff383b4c6c97e268f84ef4f665ed06b32d051b6b9c",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0074",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-s006",
      "sentenceText": "He would cry while reading his favorite characters’ breakup in his own novel.",
      "sentenceSha256": "14cd2f7e16cd860db919f841d19bbaa6df8bc73bedbbdff8b696d29cbf793228",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-049",
      "parentFingerprint": "f24de0ee7d9fb992e9fad4f0b223d89f591569bbf38fb88d38730d9a8a9b75a0",
      "passageSha256": "962185dbc181c6cc163474390eaef20a4e1a02403c25cb2633096601e07eff02",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0075",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-s007",
      "sentenceText": "He was unconventional, even defiant.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8fbd0740d60c9d71dca33f7b255a9942d3246c4bc1f8d7ef50d541657c8c88e2",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-049",
      "parentFingerprint": "f24de0ee7d9fb992e9fad4f0b223d89f591569bbf38fb88d38730d9a8a9b75a0",
      "passageSha256": "962185dbc181c6cc163474390eaef20a4e1a02403c25cb2633096601e07eff02",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0076",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-s008",
      "sentenceText": "In the late 1960s he wrote a series of anti-Mao articles, which put Cha on the Chinese Communist Party’s assassination list.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c5e0c2397abe0b1e7470d73b1f557a8bb58b00c15e13bb691f2e740a35bc8c87",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-049",
      "parentFingerprint": "f24de0ee7d9fb992e9fad4f0b223d89f591569bbf38fb88d38730d9a8a9b75a0",
      "passageSha256": "962185dbc181c6cc163474390eaef20a4e1a02403c25cb2633096601e07eff02",
      "pdfPages": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0077",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-s009",
      "sentenceText": "He escaped to Singapore and stayed there for almost a year to avoid assassination.",
      "sentenceSha256": "dd08d306df5abd48cf6abe50656e2bd6806bbbe8eb017e638a5ade73f3216db7",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p060-05040-r009-011",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-050",
      "parentFingerprint": "9e5f49da64db999e2078e45a72488474b88ce9744345f57538e4fdf1789ea1a3",
      "passageSha256": "cc0dc508ccbf723b0380928631a96f3436605e2e88db3e5ca1dcec2ed8cb6bdd",
      "pdfPages": [
        60,
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0078",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p061-01335-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Personality psychologists have classified openness to experience into two subfactors: openness and intellect.",
      "sentenceSha256": "6f80154f793dc33053f5e46bc636866c79089c0383d7523e1e2407d679ca2e3f",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p061-01335-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-051",
      "parentFingerprint": "c1010f0b54a8a6def0420b3f3ab65e48593039d52c637b6c71df70befa87c1ce",
      "passageSha256": "3075b4f93b8ce75409d7bf8539d7b4ddff4ce43a30b17e07647ef25d548342ff",
      "pdfPages": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0079",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s03-p061-01335-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Simon Ramo must have been high in the intellect dimension of openness to experience, as he explored and found many creative solutions to diverse engineering problems, while Louis Cha must have been high in the openness dimension, as he led an emotionally rich, imaginative life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "9a55a5fe87af5987cf892679a5945fabcbc22290447224bb0b8386d89a925883",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s03-p061-01335-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-051",
      "parentFingerprint": "c1010f0b54a8a6def0420b3f3ab65e48593039d52c637b6c71df70befa87c1ce",
      "passageSha256": "3075b4f93b8ce75409d7bf8539d7b4ddff4ce43a30b17e07647ef25d548342ff",
      "pdfPages": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0080",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s04-p061-03405-s001",
      "sentenceText": "While the link between openness to experience and psychological richness seems obvious, the role of extraversion in a psychologically rich life might not be.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b2ab119d60191f68950d5f7fe4ea253c5ca3d086cd15c2c1044adf59dbf52138",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s04-p061-03405-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-052",
      "parentFingerprint": "d250bab098e4ccb0c4bc3ec8794b2748d60ffd640a3a5f64d8ba7f1a15c435c6",
      "passageSha256": "dae035feebce5cb015958f36b417c05ea4c462360b9fe4128ecf75dbe87c2b42",
      "pdfPages": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0081",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s04-p061-03405-s002",
      "sentenceText": "The easiest way to think about the link is to conceive of extraversion as an interest in exploring the social world.",
      "sentenceSha256": "72f1a0b200af96179d159b85f7ffc6f8d52e74d861e5461de76e576ddce3b1f3",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s04-p061-03405-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-052",
      "parentFingerprint": "d250bab098e4ccb0c4bc3ec8794b2748d60ffd640a3a5f64d8ba7f1a15c435c6",
      "passageSha256": "dae035feebce5cb015958f36b417c05ea4c462360b9fe4128ecf75dbe87c2b42",
      "pdfPages": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0082",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s04-p061-03405-s004",
      "sentenceText": "If open people are curious about ideas, extraverts are curious about other people.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1b038c261d4d65cd3846c7b435939d1ccac7f2c08ebf3a4b38631b02bf4bd5b5",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s04-p061-03405-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-052",
      "parentFingerprint": "d250bab098e4ccb0c4bc3ec8794b2748d60ffd640a3a5f64d8ba7f1a15c435c6",
      "passageSha256": "dae035feebce5cb015958f36b417c05ea4c462360b9fe4128ecf75dbe87c2b42",
      "pdfPages": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0083",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s04-p061-05160-s001",
      "sentenceText": "At a party, who do you talk to?",
      "sentenceSha256": "1a4295bff5abbe45702f7ff05a6e60b4616df60e49c670fc277eecff51a3dd23",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s04-p061-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-054",
      "parentFingerprint": "2d72d580f93d66bea95b6026a209e7c246b464b8d206d44ee3a4329e8d827903",
      "passageSha256": "a0601c5fb233dec2c03c0406646de790a30f187df8f6c1c1b0604b3ddb59a44b",
      "pdfPages": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0084",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s04-p061-05160-s002",
      "sentenceText": "I am an introvert, so I gravitate toward someone I already know.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1d2da2d74f6353ef0d1085be38f7c615eef744c694d112e18fbb4e191469a11e",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s04-p061-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-054",
      "parentFingerprint": "2d72d580f93d66bea95b6026a209e7c246b464b8d206d44ee3a4329e8d827903",
      "passageSha256": "a0601c5fb233dec2c03c0406646de790a30f187df8f6c1c1b0604b3ddb59a44b",
      "pdfPages": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0085",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s04-p061-05160-s004",
      "sentenceText": "An extravert has a very different strategy.",
      "sentenceSha256": "add287df97c5933e2590412cc83231a81607c0bb9ac8bb98233e50a2e96e855e",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s04-p061-05160-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-054",
      "parentFingerprint": "2d72d580f93d66bea95b6026a209e7c246b464b8d206d44ee3a4329e8d827903",
      "passageSha256": "a0601c5fb233dec2c03c0406646de790a30f187df8f6c1c1b0604b3ddb59a44b",
      "pdfPages": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0086",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s04-p061-05160-s005",
      "sentenceText": "They talk to many new people and make more friends.",
      "sentenceSha256": "373af50f839bb10c5459ac026a181f2e0293be4978f654abdcc7ba73f1a7e118",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s04-p061-05160-r005-008",
